acceptance_criteria: "The CLI and SDK recovery for a refused complete list preserve an explicit includeBody request and use canonical flags; Specs cover a caller requesting bodies, one not requesting them, and empty bodies, executing the emitted recovery against the same fixture and comparing bodies, typed edges, learnings and counts; Page-incomplete refusal and the corpus safety invariants are unchanged"
